[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146713177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109046#issuecomment-3146713177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109046","id":3146713177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67jwhZ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T20:37:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T20:37:33Z","body":"CC @lawnjelly Do you mind testing this out since you were able to reproduce the crash? ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146713177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3178224542","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109046#issuecomment-3178224542","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109046","id":3178224542,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69b9ue","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T08:15:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T08:21:09Z","body":"Sorry I must have missed this last week, I've had a go but it's proving very difficult to test so far.\r\n\r\nI can confirm that the crash happens on the official build of 4.5 dev 5 (when accesskit is not set to disabled in the editor settings). _However_, although I previously noticed the crash didn't happen in dev builds, on testing further, it doesn't happen for me on locally built release builds _either_.\r\n\r\nI first checked this with current master, then rebuilt with the commit for 4.5 dev 5, and sure enough no crash with the local build. So there appears something special about the official build that is triggering the crash (maybe it isn't building in the accesskit stuff in my local builds for some reason?).\r\n\r\nI also can't test the mono builds from the linux artifacts currently as I don't have all the .NET stuff installed (I tend to test the windows builds under WINE for this reason, which wouldn't be super helpful in this case, and can confirm the WINE build runs fine).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3178224542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3178250997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109046#issuecomment-3178250997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109046","id":3178250997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69cEL1","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T08:21:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T08:21:28Z","body":"> So there appears something special about the official build that is triggering the crash (maybe it isn't building in the accesskit stuff in my local builds for some reason?).\r\n\r\nYou need prebuilt static libraries from https://github.com/godotengine/godot-accesskit-c-static/releases and `accesskit_sdk_path={PATH_EXTRACTED_ARCHIVE}` SCons flag to build with AccessKit enabled.","author_association":"MEMBER","reaction